      "station": "crafting_table",
      "origin": "voxelhaven",
      "source": {
        "page": null,
        "category": null,
        "note": "Vanilla has no recipe that returns a container, because its only container recipes (Cake, Honey Block) need milk, sugar, eggs, wheat or honey, none of which exist in Voxelhaven. This original recipe keeps the wiki's remainder semantics reachable in real play: a water bucket wets loam until turf grows on it, and the empty bucket comes back. Turf is otherwise unobtainable, since mining it yields loam the way vanilla grass does."
      }
    },
